{"pageid":5080,"title":"Bluepinkgill Mushroom","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Bluepinkgill Mushroom</span>","revid":21806,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Bluepinkgill Mushrooms are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushroom</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a>.\n</p><p>The mushroom has two different variations one that only has the main shoot and cap and another that includes a large root system on the ground (the root system is also detached when the main log is cut down) . The mushroom is a light blue and slightly transparent. The cap emits water particles when a player is nearby, when processed it loses it's transparent properties.\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Bluepinkgill Mushroom</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>