ands/images/f/f9/Bluepinkgill_Mushrooms_Cave.png/revision/latest?cb=20260601192324\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Cave where Bluepinkgill Mushroom spawn\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f9/Bluepinkgill_Mushrooms_Cave.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/410?cb=20260601192324\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"410\" height=\"224\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Bluepinkgill Mushrooms Cave.png\" data-image-key=\"Bluepinkgill_Mushrooms_Cave.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Bluepinkgill_Mushrooms_Cave.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Cave where Bluepinkgill Mushroom spawn</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br />\nDue to the area containing of many water holes that can complicate harvesting it is recomended to have a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">refined scuba tank</a> to allow to collect logs that fall to the seafloor. to reach the log you walk on the provided stone pathways or parkour across the root systems. \n</p><p>They were added in the version 118.0( <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a> Revamp) update on May 30, 2026.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902124303\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 27/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019532/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.143      1 Template:Wood\n100